# Tracked short links (28 Sep 2026). Status 200 is a rewrite, not a redirect:
# the visitor sees the normal page, but the address bar keeps the short path,
# so Cloudflare Web Analytics counts each channel separately under Paths.
# Cloudflare ignores ?utm= tags, which is why these are paths instead.
# Every page carries a canonical tag, so search engines index the real page.
/ig             /index.html                  200
/ig-docket      /weekly-docket.html          200
